# gstack + security (Revsy)

## gstack (install globally, not in this repo)

Before large features or releases, use [gstack](https://github.com/garrytan/gstack):

1. Install: `git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/garrytan/gstack.git ~/.claude/skills/gstack && cd ~/.claude/skills/gstack && ./setup --host cursor`
2. Security pass: **`/cso`** on this repo
3. Code review: **`/review`** on the branch
4. Pre-release: **`/qa`** on staging URL

See `docs/SECURITY.md` for Strix dynamic scans and env checklist.

## Revsy security defaults

- Never commit `server/.env` or paste secrets into issues/chat
- Production: `CRON_SECRET`, `FRONTEND_URL`, `WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN` required
- Sign-up is **invite-only** in production unless `SIGNUP_MODE=open`
- Admin routes must stay behind `adminAuth`; no service role keys in client
- Run `npm run security:audit` before deploy
